{"id": "section-body-01664", "title": "General Anaesthesia", "chapterId": "chapter-two", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "ANAESTHESIA AND CRITICAL CARE", "Anaesthesia", "General Anaesthesia"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-01664", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "General Anaesthesia", "runs": [{"text": "General"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Anaesthesia"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1850"}}, {"id": "body-01665", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "General anaesthetics are used for the induction of anaesthesia as boluses or for the maintenance of anaesthesia as continuous infusions in Total Intravenous Anaesthesia (TIVA). Respiratory depression occurs following the induction of General anaesthesia and ventilation should be supported as required. Administer at appropriate doses, after consideration of patient factors, surgical factors and contraindications.", "runs": [{"text": "General anaesthetics are used for the induction of anaesthesia as boluses or for the maintenance of anaesthesia as continuous infusions in Total Intravenous Anaesthesia (TIVA). Respiratory depression occurs following the induction of General"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "anaesthesia"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ventilation"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "supported"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "as"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "required."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Administer"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "at"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "appropriate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "doses,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "after"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "consideration"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of patient factors, surgical factors and contraindications."}]}, {"id": "body-01667", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Intravenous anaesthetic agents (for induction and/or maintenance)", "runs": [{"text": "Intravenous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "anaesthetic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "agents"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "induction"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and/or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "maintenance)"}]}, {"id": "body-01669", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-01671", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "B: ketamine (IV) 1–2mg/kg (For induction, however can be used for maintenance under TIVA, but contraindicated in those who a significant rise in BP/IOP/ICP would constitute a serious hazard)", "runs": [{"text": "B: ", "bold": true}, {"text": "ketamine (IV) 1–2mg/kg (For induction, however can be used for maintenance under TIVA, but contraindicated in those who a significant rise in BP/IOP/ICP would constitute a serious hazard)"}]}, {"id": "body-01672", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-01673", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "C: thiopental (IV) 3–5mg/kg for induction only.", "runs": [{"text": "C:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "thiopental"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(IV)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "3–5mg/kg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "induction"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "only."}]}, {"id": "body-01674", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "[however not recommended for maintenance or repeated dose]", "runs": [{"text": "[however"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "recommended"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "maintenance"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "repeated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dose]"}]}, {"id": "body-01675", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "